  "detail_url": "https://api.sam.gov/prod/opportunities/v1/noticedesc?noticeid=bbd4692ea5db4817b2e8ef70040167e3",
  "detail_text": "The purpose of this notice is to: -Update industry on the United States Census Bureau (USCB) 2030 Census Questionnaire Assistance (CQA) requirement. -Identify parties having an interest in and the resources to support this requirement for 2030 CQA. -Request vendor feedback that can contribute to determining the final method of acquisition. -Provide notice/instruction for the 2030 CQA Virtual Industry Day. Please see the attached documents: -Market Research, Capability Call, and Virtual Industry Day Announcement: 2030 Census Questionnaire Assistance (CQA) -Draft 2030 CQA Requirements Document (PDF File) -2030 CQA Questions & Comments Template (Excel File). Final Responses to this Notice and the Requirements Document are due no later than 4:00 pm EST, May 15, 2026 . The CQA virtual Industry Day will be held Thursday, May 7, 2026, from 1:00 pm EST to 2:00 pm EST. Questions to be considered for Industry Day response must be submitted no later than 4:00 pm EST on April 27, 2026 . Please read this notice and associated instructions carefully as you must register to attend this industry day. ADDED INDUSTRY DAY WEBINAR REGISTRATION LINK",
